Date: Sun, 7 Jun 2026 21:11:16 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 00870/11171] [outer-loop] Fix base-model choice: Qwen3.5-0.8B
 (trainable), not Qwen2.5; Qwen3.6 is GGUF-only

Operator caught the lazy Qwen2.5 default. The SOTA Qwen3.6-35B-A3B is cached only as
GGUF (inference-only, NOT fine-tunable) -> it's the verifier/inference SOTA, not a
trainable generator base. Corrected: PoC on Qwen3.5-0.8B (recent, trainable, cached,
project-native per-token-EBM family), scale to Qwen3.5-9B/27B (LoRA on 2x3090). Qwen3.6
generator would need a non-GGUF base download + 35B-A3B MoE LoRA (heavier; only after
mechanism proven).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
